e that is simply not ready for prime time.VinFast heavily markets 3 years of free charging,…","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf6/misleading-promises-from-unreliable-car-340254.htm"},{"title":"I Personally Suggest To Everyone, Dont Think Too Much. Go To Vinfast","rating":5,"date":"Jun 14, 2026","text":"It was a very nice car for this generation, EV segment cars, the car interior was completely designed by best engineers, more over I like the comfort, that was extremely next level, so I personally suggest don't think too much by the wind, first class for electrical, its future and exterior also designed very nicely.","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf6/i-personally-suggest-to-everyone-dont-think-too-much-go-to-vinfast-339883.htm"},{"title":"Best Electric EV  Car In This Subcontinent","rating":5,"date":"Jun 05, 2026","text":"Very nice experience. Jab se maine yah car liya hai, main bahut hi khush hun. Iska mileage, iska power, iska performance and iska ground clearance kafi shandar hai. Main iske pahle bhi bahut sare electric gadi ko search kar chuka tha, lekin maine sare features ko jab milake dekha, to mujhe laga ki yah jo hai vinfast…","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf6/best-electric-ev-car-in-this-subcontinent-339715.htm"},{"title":"It's A Very Good Car","rating":4.3,"date":"Apr 16, 2026","text":"Its a very good car, very comfartable and very good performance and gives a good milage. The car requires very low maintaince cost and it has good feautures the design of the car is also good but i didnt liked the front part a little but the car is huge and heavy thats is why i like the front, but feels empty.","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf6/its-a-very-good-car-338677.htm"},{"title":"Powerful And Safest Car In India Subcontinent","rating":5,"date":"Jan 27, 2026","text":"Overall vinfast is a most powerful and safest car in India subcontinent, I buy this car for daily running purpose but I