nfast-vf7-honest-take-341973.htm"},{"title":"Overall Review","rating":4.8,"date":"May 25, 2026","text":"First comes the overall look it's stunning it's my personal favourite. i have urban mint sky vf7 it's has a eye catching apperance on the road. performance: Its ride quality is superb. mileage round 400 per full charge. it has a tons of power on the wheels. smooth and easy to handle and it's very stable. Need to…","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/overall-review-339467.htm"},{"title":"Genuine Review","rating":5,"date":"May 11, 2026","text":"Very top class car. booked as I got good reviews in cardekho. Which make me more confident to choose this car and make decision. excellent performance, all wheel drive and with less features, less glitches. Buy back guarantee is also provided by the company which makes it easier to return the car or upgrade it.","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/genuine-review-339175.htm"},{"title":"Well Performed So Far. Far Better Than Expectation","rating":4.7,"date":"May 02, 2026","text":"I drove this car around 3500 km. The car features are outstanding. I am using vf7 sky infinity, it cost 30 lakh on road. Good and excellent driving experience so far. Cons: driver seat belt difficult to wear, door dosn't support water bottle, back thigh support less, most important it dosn't automatically restart…","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/well-performed-so-far-far-better-than-expectation-339006.htm"},{"title":"Cost Is Very High","rating":3.5,"date":"Mar 26, 2026","text":"Cost and car didn't match.. Cost is high as compare to car Style is ok Brand is new so trusting new brand in India is so hard to trust. If service Centre and service is provided good than they can survive in Indian market . Now Indians also focus on safety features. Good safety features is very needed.","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/cost-is-very-high-338199.htm"},{"title":"Vinfast V7","rating":5,"date":"Feb 28, 2026","text":"Ultimate experience in the car outstanding performance very good mileage i appreciate to this company tried to test drive VF6 V7 looking good nd interior design too much good sitting is very comfortable 6 air bags, touch screen, air conditioner, very good flow, chill car automatic climate, control good features.","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/vinfast-v7-337614.htm"},{"title":"Nothing Compares","rating":4.5,"date":"Jan 03, 2026","text":"VF7 gets the whole package beautifully wrapped in a well engineered machine, It has everything a car should be, and not just a gimmicky toy. I believe people that want a better machine should definitely give Vinfast a try and take that leap with the Car. Absolutely love it. If Vinfast expands in the whole country, It…","url":"https://www.cardekho.com/user-review/vinfast-vf7/nothing-compares-335605.htm"}],"dist":{"5":3,"4":7,"3":2,"2":0,"1":0}},"o":{"v":["Earth","Wind","Wind Infinity","Sky","Sky Infinity"],"f":["Electric","Electric","Electric","Electric","Electric"],"c":{"new-delhi":[[2299000,4600,93109,22990],[2589000,4600,121893,25890],[2639000,4600,123766,26390],[2749000,4600,127889,27490],[2809000,4600,130137,28090]],"mumbai":[[2299000,0,93109,22990],[2589000,0,121893,25890],[2639000,0,123766,26390],[2749000,0,127889,27490],[2809000,0,130137,28090]],"pune":[[2299000,0,93109,22990],[2589000,0,121893,25890],[2639000,0,123766,26390],[2749000,0,127889,27490],[2809000,0,130137,28090]],"nagpur":[[2299000,0,93109,22990],[2589000,0,121893,25890],[2639000,0,123766,26390],[2749000,0,127889,27490],[2809000,0,130137,28090]],"bangalore":[[2299000,212651,93109,22990],[2589000,295879,121893,25890],[2639000,301429,123766,26390],[2749000,313639,127889,27490],[2809000,320299,130137,28090]],"hyderabad":[[2299000,16000,100000,22990],[2589000,16000,110000,25890],[2639000,16000,113000,26390],[2749000,16000,115000,27490],[2809000,16000,118000,28090]],"chennai":[[2299000,1500,93109,22990],[258